
                       geant4-11-04-ref-10
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Keep G4cout and G4cerr file destinations independent in G4MTcoutDestination,
   preserving the other stream's files when replacing or restoring a destination.
   Preserve file redirection when buffering is requested.
 o Added explicit field integration driver selection through G4FieldParameters
   and dedicated UI command.
 o In G4VoxelNavigation and G4VoxelSafety, use AffineTransform's
   InverseTransformPoint() instead of calling Inverse() and then
   TransformPoint(), avoiding extra work.
 o In G4Transportation, offer the end-point isotropic safety to
   G4PropagatorInField via a new method UpdateSafety(..), when transport and
   propagator use the same navigator. This avoids recomputing the end-point
   safety at every step when steps are short.
 o Sanity fixes and optiminisations to CSG and specific solids.
 o Added optional high-precision GDML export.
 o In G4MaterialPropertiesTable, replaced linear property-name searches with
   with binary searches over sorted index vectors, avoiding duplicate strings
   and per-entry allocations.
 o Build cross-section tables for multiple-scattering models on master thread
   for G4TransportationWithMsc.
 o Extension of INCLXX for in-flight antideuteron interactions.
 o Corrected the acceptance-rejection algorithm for generating the polar
   angle in Bertini Cascade.
 o Fixed wrong sampling of target isotope in neutron capture reactions in
   G4NeutronHPCaptureData.
 o Removes obsolete "phonon" module and extended example, processes are now
   integral part of the G4CMP package.
 o Code review and sanity fixes to electromagnetic extended examples.

