    a caller offer an isotropic safety computed at 'position' (e.g. at the end
    point of a step). It replaces the remembered safety only if it is larger
    at that point, so that following chords inside it can skip the navigator.
  o In G4VoxelNavigation and G4VoxelSafety, use AffineTransform's
    InverseTransformPoint() instead of calling Inverse() and then
    TransformPoint(), avoiding extra work.
